        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLN1040SMTSS4, Modern Stainless Steel Delano Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 40 Inch Delano Door Pull is a great pull for the retro-modern design aesthetic that is so popular right now. It is huge, measuring 40 inches across and 12 inches wide. This stainless steel door pull is available in a few different finishes. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted or back-to-back mounted.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLN01-installed.jpg?v=1704354778\" width=\"259\" height=\"265\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DLN1 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLN1040SMTSS4 Modern Delano Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 40\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .38\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLN01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions Delano 1 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 Pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "40 Inch Delano Door Pull",
                "description": "The 40 Inch Delano Door Pull is a great pull for the retro-modern design aesthetic that is so popular right now. It is huge, measuring 40 inches across and 12 inches wide. This stainless steel door pull is available in a few different finishes. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted or back-to-back mounted.",
